OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan for former social club
OL,4,Aset for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to build houses on the cleared
OL,7,Fsite of a social club looks set to be
OL,8,Fapproved.
OL,10,FDemolition of the former Enterprise
OL,11,FSports and Social Club in Station Road,
OL,12,FIlkeston, began in June 2025.
OL,14,FPlans to build 16 two-storey, two-bed
OL,15,Fsemi-detached houses in its place have
OL,16,Fbeen recommended for approval when
OL,17,Fplanners at Erewash Borough Council
OL,18,Fmeet on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
