OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan for former social club
OL,4,Aset for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of four objection letters have
OL,7,Fbeen submitted to the council with
OL,8,Fconcerns over loss of privacy, light,
OL,9,Fbiodiversity and coal mining history
OL,10,Falong with flooding and knotweed.
